cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use BoaMotion, please cite both this software and the MUSCLEMOTION paper it is
  ported from.
title: BoaMotion
abstract: >-
  A Python port of the MUSCLEMOTION ImageJ/FIJI macro, measuring the strength and speed of
  muscle contraction from video microscopy recordings.
type: software
version: 0.1.0
license: GPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/quasar1357/boamotion"
authors:
  - family-names: Schwob
    given-names: Roman
    affiliation: "Data Science Lab, University of Bern"
references:
  - type: article
    title: >-
      MUSCLEMOTION: A Versatile Open Software Tool to Quantify Cardiomyocyte and Cardiac
      Muscle Contraction In Vitro and In Vivo
    journal: Circulation Research
    year: 2018
    volume: 122
    issue: 3
    start: e5
    end: e16
